Third-party algorithmic reference
---------------------------------
ssh_remote_mcp/remote_text_editor.py reuses the safe-edit algorithm
(SHA-256 conflict detection + line-range patch model) from
tumf/mcp-text-editor (MIT, Copyright (c) 2024 tumf,
https://github.com/tumf/mcp-text-editor). No source code was copied;
the implementation is original and targets AsyncSSH SFTP. See
SECURITY.md § "References & Algorithmic Provenance" for the design
diff and the rationale.
